{"type":"message","id":"3f67f575","parentId":"e87072cd","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:06:40.375Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to create a Skill from their WeChat chat records. They mentioned the path is `F:\\Wechat shuju\\文案整理\\私聊\\TXT`. \n\nWait, let me re-read: \"帮我把我自己馏成 Skill\" - I think they meant \"帮我把我自己做成 Skill\" (help me make myself into a Skill) or perhaps \"帮我把聊天记录馏成 Skill\" (help me turn chat records into a Skill). The context is they want to create a skill from their WeChat private chat logs.\n\nBut wait - \"馏成\" might be a typo for \"做成\" (make into). Let me think about this more carefully.\n\nThe user wants to create a Skill based on their WeChat chat history located at `F:\\Wechat shuju\\文案整理\\私聊\\TXT`.\n\nI should first check what files are in that directory to understand the format and content. Then I can help them create a skill from it.\n\nLet me first explore the directory to see what we're working with.","thinkingSignature":"1046584af7c887f05c586675969bc0c58c5f68c9201546ed126deae25872c6ca"},{"type":"text","text":"我来先看看你的微信聊天记录文件结构和内容。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8oryk6egfb9x_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"dir /b \"F:\\Wechat shuju\\文案整理\\私聊\\TXT\" 2>nul | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":141,"output":273,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":98,"totalTokens":33346,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775919986441,"responseId":"062996710136b07a36d86657959b9a79"}}
